                "loc": "DEU.16.1+DEU.16.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cik 16:1-2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth owaco ri Musa kodi Aron i piny Misir ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Dwe me bino bedo riwin, dwe marapena ma oro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Miy Joisiraili je cik me; k'apar ma dwe me, kisi jacwo ripo yero nyathi rombo kosa nyathi diel wok i ot pere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka peco pere thin ri nyathi rombo acel, jowopoki gi jager pere cungo kwoŋ welo ma ji kodi adec ma kisi nyatoro nyalo camo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Winyalo yero nyathi rombo kosa diel, to joripo bedo ma jokitwo, ma k'oŋol kosa waŋe k'otho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka othieno ma ndelo k'apar g'aŋwen ma dwe me, Joisiraili je jowothum ogwaŋe pajo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jowokwany remo moro to joreyo i miango thigo kodi ruwaŋ dhiot ma udi m'ilacam'iye ogwaŋe no.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wor no riŋo wobul, t'icamo gi yen makec kodi mugat ma buthow. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikiri wicam manumu, kosa m'otedi, to cami win je m'obul, kiri gi wic, tiende, kodi gigipiny ma iye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikiripi weyo kada mathin tundo odikin, ka man odoŋ, wiripo waŋo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wicam piyo munyo witieko rukirok ma woth, gi ware mewin i tiendi win kodi ludhe mewin i cingi win. Obedo kalima ma kadho ma miyan Rwoth, dwoŋ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wor no abino wotho i lowo ma Misir, neko kisi okayo, ji g'ogwaŋe, kodi miyo werin ma Misir gir'acula. An abedo Rwoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Remo bino bedo ranyuth ma nyutho udi mewin ma wibedo iye. K'aneno remo, abino kalo win m'akimiyo win litho k'amiyo Jomisir gir'acula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiripo poyo ndelo me, aka wikuri paka kalima pa Rwoth. Wiripo timo i luse mewin je paka cik i hongo je ma bino.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kalima ma Mugat ma buthow",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth owaco ni, “Ma ndelo abirio wiripo camo mugat ma buthow. I ndelo marapena wongoye thow ma wonwaŋere i udi mewin, kole ka nyatoro ocam mugat m'otimi gi thow i ndelo abirio no, k'okwanere paka acel kwoŋ ji paran kendo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I ndelo marapena kodi i ndelo mar'abirio wiripo romo lamo Rwoth. Wikiripi timo tic i ndelo abirio no, to winyalo tedo cemo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Poyi win kalima me, kwoŋbedo i ndelo me am'awodh'iye nonin mewin wok i Misir. I luse mewin je wiripo timo kalima me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Othieno ma k'apar g'aŋwen kiri othieno ma ka ndelo piero ario g'acel ma dwe marapena, wiripo camo mugat ma buthow. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma ndelo abirio wongoye thow ma wonwaŋere i udi mewin, kole ka nyatoro, anywola mewin kosa japath, ocam mugat m'otimi gi thow, k'okwanere paka acel kwoŋ ji paran kendo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.19+EXO.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.19",
              "EXO.12.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kalima ma Kadho marapena",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.19+EXO.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.19",
              "EXO.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Musa olwoŋo jotel ma Isiraili aka owaco rijo ni, “Kisi nyatoro kwoŋ win woyeri nyathi rombo kosa nyathi diel ma cwo, aka withum ŋey pecin mewin jowocami kalima ma kadho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwany win cangwe, aka wirwaki i remo to wiwiro i miango ma thigo kodi ruwaŋ dhiot. Wongoye ŋata wowoki cuka piny oyawere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.11.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ebu 11:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole Rwoth bino wotho i Misir neko Jomisir, aka ka go onen remo i miango thigo kodi ruwaŋ dhiot, go k'owey Malaika ma Tho donjo i udi mewin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Win kodi nyithindho mewin wiripo luwo cik me cil gi cil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka ka witundo i lowo ma Rwoth omiy win paka ociko, wiripo timo kwer me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka nyithindho mewin jopenji win ni, ‘Kwer me nyutho aŋo.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dwoki win jo ni, ‘Me cowirok ma Kalima ma Kadho ma miyo Rwoth dwoŋ, kwoŋbedo go okalo udi pa Joisiraili i Misir. Go oneko Jomisir to weyo wan.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joisiraili jokule piny to jolamo Rwoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
